(5, 1, '5 Functional Electric ICU Bed', 'Premium 5 Functional Electric ICU Bed Supplier in India | A One Hospicare', 'Get the best 5 Functional Electric ICU Bed Manufacturer prices at A One Hospicare. We are specialized Hospital Beds & Cradles suppliers for top hospitals and clinics nationwide.', '5 Functional Electric ICU Bed exporter, clinical 5 Functional Electric ICU Bed, Hospital Beds & Cradles manufacturer, 5 Functional Electric ICU Bed price, aone hospicare', '5-functional-electric-icu-bed-aoh-151-a', 'products/sYlK87cBexS3K05JmH51CVkV0Yq185I1blBCLzzb.jpg', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/EikQu0CNmgmJefSGOuQVgzqwsgUHvE0iszaoLNlG.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/1S5GwSkzqLclLAUtMMjRFtwK5Ju8odEZSykx2KfQ.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/Veii8SCYioXPOO08WTwLUb8hHWTXYPBYdBzF0k22.jpg\"]', 'DURABLE BUILD:\r\nMS PERFORATED TOP WITH A POWDER-COATED FRAME\r\nFOR LONG-LASTING USE.\r\nADVANCED FUNCTIONALITY:\r\nBACKREST ADJUSTMENT: 0° TO 75°\r\nLEG REST ADJUSTMENT: 0° TO 45°\r\nHEIGHT ADJUSTMENT: 500 MM TO 750 MM\r\nTRENDELENBURG & REVERSE TRENDELENBURG\r\nABS PANELS & SIDE RAILS', 'AOH 151 (A)', '9402', 49700.00, 18.00, '2026-04-23 06:33:26', '2026-05-06 04:25:33', 0, 1),
